	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Rev A room node: ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8, USB-C 5 V in, 3.3 V LDO.\nAll sheets connect through global labels and the +5V / +3V3 / GND power symbols.\nSource of truth: docs/pcb/schematic.md and docs/pcb/pinout.md.\nPower tree: USB-C VBUS (+5V) -> AP7361C LDO -> +3V3 (module, mic, AHT20, e-paper).\n+5V also feeds the MAX98357A amp and the LED strip."
